# Architecture (adapter)

**Primary source:** [`AGENTS.md`](../../AGENTS.md). Follow it for any coding agent.

Essentials for `src/**/*`:

- Direction: `pages` -> `modules` (`components` -> `hooks` -> `service`) -> shared
- Components must not import `service/` or call fetch/axios directly
- Hooks may call service; service must not import UI/pages
- Expose modules via `index.ts` only
- Prefer sibling `react-vite-boilerplate` for greenfield work
- Do not invent `@/shared`, `@/contexts`, or `@/services` aliases
